# Search-tool ignore file (ripgrep, fd, ag — gitignore syntax). NOT a VCS
# ignore: archived material is tracked in git and must stay tracked.
#
# docs/_archive/ holds ~460 superseded docs whose filenames collide with live
# canon (navigation-contract, architecture-*, memory-architecture-*, …).
# Excluding them from default searches keeps archived and live hits from
# appearing side by side with nothing distinguishing them (WI-2658).
#
# To search the archive deliberately:
#   rg --no-ignore <pattern> docs/_archive/     (or rg -u.)
#   fd --no-ignore <pattern> docs/_archive/
docs/_archive/
